(16, 'admin', 1, 1, 'Feme Hair Lotion Ampoules 15amp', 'feme-hair-lotion-ampoules-RqV1Vn', 'physical', '[{\"id\":\"8\",\"position\":1},{\"id\":\"15\",\"position\":2}]', '8', '15', NULL, 3, 'pc', 1, 1, NULL, '', NULL, '[{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6292c42061a.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a62937c33957.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a62937e85e88.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a62937fec66d.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a629380dc747.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"}]', '[]', '2026-07-14-6a567132b5f17.webp', 'public', '', 'public', NULL, NULL, 'youtube', NULL, '[]', 0, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 0, 555555555.00000000000000000000, 0.00000000000000000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, '0', 'flat', 0, 1, '<p><strong>Feme Hair Lotion</strong> is an innovative Italian hair treatment specially developed for weak and stressed hair. Its advanced <strong>Micro-Emulsion Technology</strong> enhances the absorption of active ingredients into the scalp, helping nourish hair follicles, reduce hair loss, and promote thicker, stronger, and healthier-looking hair.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Advanced <strong>Micro-Emulsion Technology</strong> for enhanced ingredient absorption.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Helps nourish and strengthen hair follicles.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Supports the reduction of hair loss.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Promotes thicker, fuller, and healthier-looking hair.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Formulated with active ingredients including <strong>Kopexil®</strong> and <strong>Saw Palmetto Extract</strong>.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Suitable for both men and women.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Ideal for weak, thinning, and stressed hair.</li></ol><h3>Directions for Use</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Apply one ampoule directly to a clean, dry or slightly damp scalp.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Gently massage for 2–3 minutes until fully absorbed.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Do not rinse.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use as directed by your healthcare professional or according to the recommended treatment plan.</li></ol><h3>Recommendation</h3><p>For optimal results, use consistently for <strong>at least 3 months</strong>. For a complete hair care routine, combine with <strong>Feme Hair Capsules</strong> and <strong>Feme Hair Shampoo</strong> to maximize hair strength and reduce hair loss.</p>', 0, NULL, '2026-07-15 00:26:10', '2026-07-24 05:19:44', 1, 1, 'Feme Hair Lotion | Anti Hair Loss & Hair Growth Treatment', 'Feme Hair Lotion with Micro-Emulsion Technology, Kopexil® & Saw Palmetto helps reduce hair loss, nourish follicles, and promote thicker, stronger hair.', '2026-07-14-6a567132ba866.webp', 1, NULL, 0.00000000000000000000, 0, NULL, NULL, 'UE943T'),
(17, 'admin', 1, 1, 'Vitamin Factory shampoo 200ml', 'vitamin-factory-shampoo-EF9SAf', 'physical', '[{\"id\":\"8\",\"position\":1},{\"id\":\"14\",\"position\":2}]', '8', '14', NULL, 3, 'pc', 1, 1, NULL, '', NULL, '[{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6290dfda954.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291e9c6b6d.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291eb4572a.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291ecdb096.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291ee6690b.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291f01be9e.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291f1b8c7a.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a6291f361235.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"}]', '[]', '2026-07-14-6a5671be5b6b2.webp', 'public', '', 'public', NULL, NULL, 'youtube', NULL, '[]', 0, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 0, 200000.00000000000000000000, 0.00000000000000000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, '0', 'flat', 0, 1, '<p><strong>Feme Hair Shampoo</strong> is a moisturizing daily shampoo formulated with <strong>Caffeine, Arginine, and 5% Urea</strong> to help stimulate the scalp, strengthen hair follicles, and maintain healthy hair. Its <strong>pH 5.5</strong> balanced formula supports the scalp\'s natural barrier while gently cleansing without harsh surfactants or common allergens, making it suitable for everyday use.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Moisturizes the hair and scalp.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Enriched with <strong>Caffeine</strong> to help stimulate the scalp.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Contains <strong>Arginine</strong> to support healthy-looking hair.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Formulated with <strong>5% Urea</strong> for added scalp hydration.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Maintains a healthy <strong>pH 5.5</strong> balance.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Helps strengthen hair follicles.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Free from harsh surfactants and common allergens.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Suitable for all hair types.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Gentle enough for daily use.</li></ol><h3>Directions for Use</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Wet the hair thoroughly.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Apply an appropriate amount of shampoo and gently massage the scalp for 2–3 minutes.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Rinse thoroughly with water.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Repeat if necessary.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Suitable for daily use.</li></ol><h3>Recommendation</h3><p>For optimal results, use daily as part of the <strong>Feme Hair</strong> hair care routine. For enhanced support against hair thinning and to promote stronger, healthier-looking hair, combine with <strong>Feme Hair Lotion</strong> and <strong>Feme Hair Capsules</strong>.</p>', 0, NULL, '2026-07-15 00:28:30', '2026-07-24 05:13:07', 1, 1, 'Feme Hair Shampoo | Daily Moisturizing Hair Growth Shampoo', 'Feme Hair Shampoo with Caffeine, Arginine & 5% Urea gently cleanses, hydrates the scalp, strengthens hair follicles, and supports healthier, stronger hair daily.', '2026-07-14-6a5671be60651.webp', 1, NULL, 0.00000000000000000000, 0, NULL, NULL, '8055765861092'),
(18, 'admin', 1, 1, 'Feme Hair Rosemary Oil 50ml', 'feme-hair-rosemary-oil-Iv6roz', 'physical', '[{\"id\":\"8\",\"position\":1},{\"id\":\"16\",\"position\":2}]', '8', '16', NULL, 3, 'pc', 1, 1, NULL, '', NULL, '[{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a628f0523530.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a628fdda5f79.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a628fdea2519.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a628fdfc3bf5.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a628fe0ec563.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"},{\"image_name\":\"2026-07-24-6a628fe1c6991.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"}]', '[]', '2026-07-24-6a628fe50a784.webp', 'public', '', 'public', NULL, NULL, 'youtube', NULL, '[]', 0, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 0, 50000.00000000000000000000, 0.00000000000000000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, '10', 'percent', 10, 1, '<p><strong>Feme Hair Rosemary Oil</strong> is an advanced <strong>microemulsion-based</strong> formula designed to enhance the absorption and effectiveness of its active ingredients. It combines <strong>Rosemary Oil</strong>, <strong>Caffeine</strong>, and <strong>Arginine</strong> to help strengthen hair, nourish the scalp, and support thicker, healthier-looking hair growth.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Advanced <strong>Microemulsion Technology</strong> for enhanced absorption.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Enriched with <strong>Rosemary Oil</strong>.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Formulated with <strong>Caffeine</strong> and <strong>Arginine</strong>.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Helps strengthen hair follicles.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Supports thicker, healthier-looking hair.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Nourishes the scalp and improves hair vitality.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Suitable for all hair types.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Ideal for regular use.</li></ol><h3>Directions for Use</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Apply <strong>4–5 drops</strong> directly to a clean scalp.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Gently massage the scalp for 2–3 minutes until fully absorbed.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Leave on without rinsing.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use daily or as directed by your healthcare professional.</li></ol><h3>Recommendation</h3><p>For optimal results, use regularly as part of the complete <strong>Feme Hair</strong> hair care routine together with <strong>Feme Hair Shampoo</strong>, <strong>Feme Hair Lotion</strong>, and <strong>Feme Hair Capsules</strong> to help promote stronger, fuller, and healthier-looking hair.</p>', 0, NULL, '2026-07-15 00:31:51', '2026-07-24 05:04:21', 1, 1, 'Feme Hair Rosemary Oil | Stronger, Thicker & Healthier Hair', 'Feme Hair Rosemary Oil with Rosemary Oil, Caffeine & Arginine uses Microemulsion technology to nourish the scalp, strengthen hair, and support healthy hair growth.', '2026-07-24-6a628fe37e8a0.png', 1, NULL, 0.00000000000000000000, 0, NULL, NULL, '8055765861078');
